{"server":"en","storyId":"act17side_level_act17side_st03","groupId":"act17side","stageId":"act17side_03","title":"Empty Street","storyCode":"SN-ST-3","avgTag":"Interlude","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act17side/level_act17side_st03.txt","sourceHash":"0e2d4bf80749a1b2957bf1be1d1118680162be0a9f2d6ff471a3138938115fa5","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"High Inquisitor","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"Irene."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Inquisitor Irene","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes, maestro... I mean, sir!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"High Inquisitor","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"You seem distracted."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Inquisitor Irene","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I... I'm fine."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"High Inquisitor","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"Gran Faro is a tiny town, so small that most maps don't even bother to list it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"High Inquisitor","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"But this is a request from Lord Carmen himself, and it involves Dr. Kal'tsit and those Ægir."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Inquisitor Irene","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I know, sir. I—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"High Inquisitor","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"If you still haven't found your answer, I will not give you permission to join the mission."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Inquisitor Irene","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I'd already made up my mind when I first decided to follow in your footsteps and become an Inquisitor."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"High Inquisitor","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes, before you even knew the question. An answer is worthless if it cannot explain what you see and hear."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"High Inquisitor","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"Don't die a worthless death, Irene. You know what we're fighting against. And you must find your own answer."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Inquisitor Irene","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Inquisitor Irene","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"...Yes, sir."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibchurch"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gladiia","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Lady Kal'tsit."},{"type":"narration","text":"Gladiia's tone does not change, but her footsteps reflect her mood.\nA blink of the eye, and she is by Kal'tsit's side."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Good work, Gladiia."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gladiia","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The Inquisition didn't do anything to you, did they?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"The fact that Iberia has not yet sunk into the sea is proof that they still retain a shred of humility and vigilance."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gladiia","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You found a way, as promised."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes. However..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Even if Iberia is willing to let go of their fears, what about Ægir?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"What about you?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gladiia","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"If this temporary cooperation is necessary to help us return to the ocean... so be it."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty","isRemote":false,"text":"Finally, an Ægir with some sense, right? Like the waves themselves, like the rays and texture of the sea."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty","isRemote":false,"text":"Hello there, special Ægir. I believe you've already met our other members?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gladiia","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes. You're also a member of AUS?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty","isRemote":false,"text":"Alty, bassist. Nice to meet you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty","isRemote":false,"text":"How are things outside?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gladiia","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The cultists are out in force, but individually they're rather weak."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gladiia","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"My Hunters can take care of everything."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"The Inquisition will only work with us once we've taken care of the problems in Gran Faro."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gladiia","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Then there's no time to waste."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Gladiia raises her lance.\nAt the same time, she senses that something is not right."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gladiia","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gladiia","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"There, among the Sea Terrors... but how could it be...?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Kal'tsit here."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elysium","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr. Kal'tsit! Their goal is—"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"...Elysium?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gladiia","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"What's the matter?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"One of our operators is in trouble."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Gladiia","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Something lurks here."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"As we discussed, Alty, the members of AUS can stay ashore."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"We'll handle this as quickly as possible."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty","isRemote":false,"text":"Sure, we can wait."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty","isRemote":false,"text":"And we'll be happy to provide some BGM for your campaign."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g16_lighthouse_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skadi","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"...Too weak."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skadi","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"They keep coming. Buying time?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skadi","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"Or spreading... something."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skadi","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"I must find the leader."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sea Terror","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"—Gkh—!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skadi","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"Specter."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"...Hm?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Ah... Skadi. Long time no see."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Something the matter?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skadi","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"...Are you alright?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm fine, just a little tired."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes... We're fighting, right? The scent of the ocean... reminds me of home."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"But, home? My home... huh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sea Terror","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Gkh—!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The sea."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The scent of the sea grows stronger. Are we home, Skadi? Is this the way home?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skadi","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"...It will be, Specter. Laurentina. I promise."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Tell me then... what's that before my eyes?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skadi","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"What?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"A figure strides down the street, humming a tune.\nThe streets are a mess in the aftermath of the panicking townsfolk, but it hardly bothers Frost as she plucks at the air and imagines music."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skadi","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"Hmph!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sea Terror","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(Slithering sounds)"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skadi","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"The Sea Terrors keep away from her. No, they ignore her. Is she... playing an instrument?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Does it sound nice?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skadi","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't know."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Then ask."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skadi","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"Wait!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g17_lighthouse_alley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elysium","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*pant*... *pant*..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elysium","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(Did I shake him?)"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elysium","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Dammit?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elysium","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Was it when we first met? No, he didn't even touch me."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ulpianus","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Those documents must be destroyed, Iberian."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ulpianus","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Obey, and you may keep your limbs. Attached, if you prefer."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elysium","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(Shit, he's fast...)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elysium","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Weren't your friends only burning them because there wasn't time to save them all?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elysium","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"With your skills, you could just as easily have taken them yourself. So why the need to burn them?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ulpianus","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"'Friends?'"},{"type":"narration","text":"The man growls from the bottom of his throat, a sound born of humiliation."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ulpianus","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"We are not 'friends.'"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elysium","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Then what?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ulpianus","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"It doesn't concern you. Surrender the documents, and leave this place."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ulpianus","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Whether you're with the Inquisition, or with another country..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ulpianus","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elysium","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(He stopped.)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ulpianus","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes... you've always been sharp."},{"type":"narration","text":"The mysterious Ægir gazes into the distance.\n'Friends.'"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ulpianus","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(Ægirian) We may be bound by blood, but you must stay away from Ægir for now."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elysium","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"—!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Elysium evades the attack, but it's immediately clear why he managed to.\nThe sword's aura rips the charred papers to shreds, sending the splintered truth drifting into the wind."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Elysium","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Crap—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ulpianus","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(Ægirian) They cannot return to Ægir just yet. Allowing everyone to act on their own will only accelerate the destruction."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ulpianus","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(Ægirian) Even though Ægir has already chosen the path of self-annihilation."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g18_lighthouse_square"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Saint Carmen","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"No more Sea Terrors approach."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Saint Carmen","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Unsurprising numbers, for the coast. Now, where are you hiding?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Wounded Cultist","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You... *cough* No! Not the lantern!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Saint Carmen","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Answer me. What do you intend for Gran Faro?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Wounded Cultist","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"That lantern! Get it off me—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Saint Carmen","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Answer me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Wounded Cultist","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Ugh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Wounded Cultist","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"It... It's..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Saint Carmen","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"What are you pointing at?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Carmen looks back in the direction that the cultist is indicating."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g18_lighthouse_square"},{"type":"narration","text":"A statue stands in the middle of the square."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Saint Carmen","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Ah."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Saint Carmen","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Gran Faro. The Great Lighthouse. Of course. You're seeking the lighthouse of Gran Faro."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g18_lighthouse_square"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Wounded Cultist","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Stop... stop it... ugh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Saint Carmen","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The nobles once called those great monuments the Eye of Iberia. Dozens of them once stood on Iberia's coastline."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Saint Carmen","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Even had the Witch King's Tower in Leithanien not been toppled, it would still have been dwarfed by these guardians of the sea."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Saint Carmen","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"They are the single greatest mark that human civilization has ever left on this land."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Wounded Cultist","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The sea... *cough* the Eye of Iberia..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Wounded Cultist","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The miracle... destroyed the sacrilege... argh... take that lantern away!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Saint Carmen","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The Profound Silence destroyed most of the lighthouses, and disabled the rest."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Saint Carmen","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"What are you plotting?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Wounded Cultist","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Saint Carmen","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I see. So you knew..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Saint Carmen","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You knew that one remained operational. That the goal of the Gran Faro project was to protect what was left of the Eye of Iberia."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Saint Carmen","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"That's why you've been lurking here, awaiting your chance."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Wounded Cultist","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Saint Carmen","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I never expected there to be traitors in the very heart of the Inquisition. Where are they?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Wounded Cultist","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Ha... hehehe..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Wounded Cultist","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"While you're here... babbling away..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Wounded Cultist","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Look under your feet... and come face to face... with your pathetic... narrow-mindedness..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Saint Carmen","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"What?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dying Sea Terror","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dying Sea Terror","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(Unsettling slithering sounds)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Saint Carmen","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Hm."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Saint Carmen","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"The Sea Terrors are... glowing?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Saint Carmen","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"What is this luminescence?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Get away from it!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Saint Carmen","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Ah—"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"(Impatient growling)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Meltdown."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"(Agitated roars)"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g16_lighthouse_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Hello."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(Peaceful riff)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"There is a familiar scent on you... Do you know what it is?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"(Spirited riff)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"A pleasant melody, but not the one that I know."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Then, how does the one you know go?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"When she prayed, the stars ceased to shimmer♪\nWhen she wept, the night let out a smile♪\nWhen she laments, the anguish sprawled upon her madness♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"...A song of Ægir. A sad song."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"But I don't like it. It belongs in the past. It lacks passion, and wallows in futile sentimentality—the same as Ægir itself."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"A shame."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"You've come home, Ægir."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Home? Me?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Sing."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"In song, you will rediscover yourself."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Song?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"What memories will singing recall?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Just sing. You will encounter your past. You must eventually find and face your destiny, or it will find you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"That's how it has ever been, since I left the ocean."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"What a strange woman. But I don't mind singing."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Then sing."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"La la la, la la la♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"When she prays, the stars ceased to shimmer♪"},{"type":"narration","text":"......\n..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amaia","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"As always, there's such sorrow in your song."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Specter","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Who are... you?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amaia","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"I never imagined we'd meet again in such circumstances, Laurentina."},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["Elysium","Kal'tsit"]},{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["Skadi"]}]}
